  name: Suspansion Test Device
  description: A suspension test machine is a device used to evaluate the performance
    of a vehicle's suspension system. It measures how effectively the shock absorbers
    and springs function in terms of ride comfort, road handling, and safety. By
    simulating vibrations, bumps, and road conditions, the machine helps detect faults
    or inefficiencies in the suspension components. It is commonly used in vehicle
    inspection centers, service workshops, and automotive R&D facilities.
